--- a/ops/changelog.md
+++ b/ops/changelog.md
@@ -8882,3 +8882,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-10: GAP-4 conductor_followup #1 — DE-SELECTION COVERAGE RUN (re-run of the poison-skipped .369 exp3987): run k=2 FRESH <=3-iteration 600s codex chains on the 11 NEVER-CHAINED ARC-2 pool tasks (the complement of the 12 probe-chain-feasible tasks in results/arc3_gap4_arc2_eval_pool.json.gz), transcripts archived, gold-leak audit with the validated word-boundary detector, gold used POST-HOC for scoring only. This de-biases the 0.8333 fresh-chain demo-perfect coverage estimate (it was measured on chain-feasible tasks only). Report the demo-perfect rate honestly whatever it is — NO all-gold bar. Per the handoff hygiene rules: commit artifacts at landing, archive every transcript, >=600s codex timeouts, never cite P(gold|agree) without n+CI. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: gap4_deselection_coverage_0.4091_n11; results/experiment_3998_gap4_deselection_coverage.json
 - 2026-06-10: GAP-4 conductor_followup #2 — PRE-REGISTERED PRECISION CONFIRMATION v2 (re-run of the poison-skipped .369 exp3988; THE confirmatory experiment): k=3 ALL-FRESH chains (no probe/stale arms), equal 600s timeouts, on NEW clean chain-feasible ARC-2 tasks, protocol committed BEFORE any call. PRIMARY gate = binomial critical-value rule: n>=19 agreement events, reject H0 p=0.52 if >=14 gold (size 0.046, power 0.837 at p=0.80). SECONDARY = precision vs the in-run fresh-arm base rate (~0.73). TERTIARY (the GAP-5 tripwire) = task-level unanimity-with-abstention on sibling-input disagreement (post-hoc 5/5 gold last round; needs fresh confirmation). One event per task where possible or pre-registered cluster collapse. Honest verdict either way; retire_if_same_verdict on the precision-uplift claim (if the agreement signal AGAIN fails to beat 0.52 with power, the agreement-as-selector claim is retired and agreement is logged as a confidence-label-only signal). EXCLUDE the flagged reuse tasks aa4ec2a5/16b78196 from the clean set. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: protocol_preregistered_pending_execution; results/experiment_3999_gap4_precision_confirmation_v2.json
 - 2026-06-10: GAP-4 conductor_followup #3 — FEEDBACK-VS-REDRAW DECIDING CONTROL (re-run of the poison-skipped .369 exp3989; same-run paired design): per task, arm A = one <=3-iteration FEEDBACK chain vs arm B = 3 INDEPENDENT singles, SAME 600s budget, INTERLEAVED within ONE codex run (the measured 2.2x between-run variance forbids cross-run comparison — all controls must be same-run). Exact McNemar/Fisher on paired task outcomes. Resolves whether feedback CONTENT beats iid resampling (current evidence ambiguous: post-feedback per-call 9/21=0.4286 ~ iter0 0.4583; iid 3-redraw predicts 0.841 vs 0.833 observed). Either outcome is a publishable mechanism finding — does the chain's feedback add value, or is it just 3 draws? Prior art (arXiv:2603.20334) argues feedback helps; this paired test confirms or refutes it on the ARC-2 venue. Honest verdict required. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: feedback_no_better_than_redraw_p1.0_FALSE_NEGATIVE_RISK; results/experiment_4000_gap4_feedback_vs_redraw.json
+- 2026-06-10: GAP-4 conductor_followup #4 — HARNESS REGISTRATION + OFFLINE TIER-STACK EVAL (re-run of the poison-skipped .369 exp3990; CPU-only, zero codex calls): register gap4_program_induction_stack in ops/verifier_registry.yaml per the synthesis recommendation (the tiered policy: snap tau<=0.005 -> promote-first-fresh-raw -> vote; agreement = confidence label only, fresh arms only); implement the tiered policy as a REUSABLE module (python/carnot/verify/ or scripts/); re-run the offline eval BIT-EXACT from the saved artifacts on the 31-entry ARC-2 pool + ARC-1 sanity (MUST reproduce ARC-2 19/31 and ARC-1 28/31); append the 446ef5d2 demo-underdetermination GAP-5 entry to ops/verifier_gaps.md with missing_verifier_gaps emitted; fix the committed cost line (45 calls / 3780.0 codex-s / 1156.5 s wall) wherever it appears in ops/. NO new codex calls — pure offline replay from saved induced programs. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: gap4_stack_registered_arc2_19of31_arc1_28of31_reproduced; results/experiment_4001_gap4_registration_offline_eval.json
